.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PHqfIWxnnS8Q7kNvwHNjaGq&_nc_oc=AdoyIXIxemVn6-P1UGcytMGFiCPLkJe-3dmFHGNeELwqjyaZ4EuStbLwf8m-z6PqDNs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRl5h5GslDsfsYb-3Netp801B-Jj35a_JgCpxsj3Ql4dQ&oe=6B006BCA"}, "display_name": "Bowliverse", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Bowliverse: The Ultimate VR Bowling Experience\n\nWelcome to \"Bowliverse,\" where the classic sport of bowling transcends the ordinary and enters a realm of immersive virtual reality. Prepare to embark on a cosmic adventure that transforms traditional bowling into an exhilarating and futuristic experience. Whether you're a seasoned bowler or new to the game, \"Bowliverse\" offers a fresh and captivating way to enjoy this beloved sport.\nGame Overview\n\n\"Bowliverse\" is a cutting-edge VR game that redefines the bowling experience by placing players in a vibrant cosmic arena. The game challenges your precision, skill, and timing as you aim to score points by knocking down pins in various celestial-themed lanes. Each game session offers a unique adventure, filled with stunning visuals and dynamic gameplay.", "short_description": "Bowliverse: The Ultimate VR Bowling Experience\n\nWelcome to \"Bowliverse,\" where the classic sport of bowling transcends the ordinary and enters a realm of immersive virtual reality. Prepare to embark on a cosmic adventure that transforms traditional bowling into an exhilarating and futuristic experience. Whether you're a seasoned bowler or new to the game, \"Bowliverse\" offers a fresh and captivating way to enjoy this beloved sport."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/bowliverse/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "KH Invention", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/bowliverse", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "conte